component seq_two_reads
banks m 1
assign m readA read 0
assign m readB read 0
component par_if_arms
conflict m ra read wbase read
conflict m rb read wbase read
banks m 2
assign m ra read 0
assign m rb read 0
assign m wbase read 1
component unused_memory
banks idle 1
banks used 1
assign used read_used read 0
component multidim_memories
banks idle 1
banks m2 1
banks s2 1
assign m2 rd read 0
assign s2 sq read 0
component main
